<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Don issues fresh cautionary.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Don issues fresh cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African hotels firm Don Group Ltd on Thursday issued a fresh cauitonary announcement to shareholders, following a series of warnings in April and May, stating it was in continuing negotiations which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>The latest notice follows a cautionary from Sable Holdings Ltd on Wednesday that it was in talks with Don.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
